# The run's knob profiles (roadmap 092 K9): world knobs whose values change over the run, along
# the simulation time or the ego's lane position on a lane anchor, piecewise linear between
# breakpoints. scensim run sends every run's (an empty list for a run with none) before SSv2
# starts; the bridge applies them each frame as SetEnvironment and records each knob's
# commanded and read-back value in the gap trace. JSON, as scenario_world_bridge's
# backend/remote/profiles.rs reads it:
#
#   {"profiles": [{"knob": "visibility", "field": "fog_visual_range", "step": 9.5,
#                  "coordinate": "time", "points": [[0, 1000], [12, 1000], [20, 80]]}]}
string profiles
---
bool success
string message
